(defbehavior smoke-s43 process ()
  "Scenario 43 (`smoke-scenario-late`), round 28 diagnosis: the Freedom League holds Freedom HQ and
   the Sewer Exit, the Krimzon Guard the Slums; the player near the bridge between Slums B and
   Slums A; every 3 s for 150 s, the bridges and the units near them."
